          {
            "title": "Question 4",
            "id": 129304,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale sarà l'output, supponendo un input di <code>10</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"age_string = input(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enter your age: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (int(age_string) &lt; \" /><text value=\"21\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Under 21&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;21 or older&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Enter your age: 10\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Under 21\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Under 21</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>21 or older</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Under 21</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Il blocco <code>if</code> viene eseguito quando la sua condizione è <code>True</code>. Altrimenti, viene eseguito il blocco <code>else</code>.</p><p>L'output mostrato usa l'input <code>10</code>. Se l'utente digita invece <code>21</code>, quale riga finale visualizza il codice?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"age_string = input(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enter your age: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (int(age_string) &lt; \" /><text value=\"21\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Under 21&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;21 or older&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Enter your age: 10\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Under 21\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>21 or older</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Under 21</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>21</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>21 or older</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 1",
            "id": 129305,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Chiedi all'utente il suo nome e memorizzalo nella variabile <code>user_name</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"user_name = input(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enter your name: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"17\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>input</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Memorizza in <code>user_name</code> la risposta al prompt <code>Enter your name: </code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"user_name = input(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enter your name: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"9\" /><option startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"37\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"name\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>user_name</code>, seguito da <code>=</code>, <code>input</code> e infine <code>\"Enter your name: \"</code>.</p></body></html>"
