            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usa la funzione <code>input</code> per memorizzare l'input dell'utente nella variabile <code>user_name</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"user_name = input()\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"9\" /><option startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>user_name</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e poi <code>input</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
